Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:49:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 57/58] Reduce bounded VU overhead with exact native FMAC
 guards

Reuse admitted native descriptors, directly transpose ordinary FMAC flags, and preserve complete MXCSR state on MSVC x64. Keep boundary arithmetic on the existing exact path. Make generated catalogs build on GCC and retain portable fenv handling.
